{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Module 03 — Equivalence Engine\n**The convergence point of VibeCheck** — compares Module 01's property suite against the code's **call-order WIR** (Module 02) and returns **COMPLIANT / VIOLATION + readable counterexample / INCONCLUSIVE**.\nSnapshot: 2026-07-30, `main-demo` @ `5c65046` (FINAL) — canonical path: `process_wir_batch()` (C++/SPOT, Phases A–D).","x":620,"y":-340,"width":760,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"input-spec","type":"text","text":"**M_spec — spec properties**\nFrom **Module 01** (LTLf strings in `module_03_input.json`)\n✅ **ingested** via `property_ingest.py` (PR #72): tier-gated (node()-free P1 only — 17.6% of tier; P0/P2/P3 excluded with reasons), de-duplicated, Option B quoted flat atoms","x":-40,"y":-80,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"input-wir","type":"text","text":"**Call-order WIR**\nFrom **Module 02** (`call_order_wir` view from `/verify`, D2 PRs #73/#75)\n✅ the actual input interface today — definition-order `wir` silently reproduces the pre-D2 bug (documented on `/check`)","x":-40,"y":140,"width":360,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"input-eqi","type":"text","text":"**EQI — Extraction Quality Index**\nExtraction confidence from **Module 02**","x":-40,"y":340,"width":360,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"phase-a","type":"text","text":"**Phase A — Lifter**\nWIR → Labeled Transition System (LTS)\n(Python ✅ / C++ ✅)","x":420,"y":60,"width":330,"height":90},
		{"id":"phase-a-detail","type":"text","text":"- Cascading action-name matching: **exact → edit-distance → Sentence-BERT** (tier 3 live in C++ via embedded pybind11)\n- `unlabeled_task` fallback — unmatched actions cannot slip through\n- Bounded loop unrolling","x":420,"y":190,"width":330,"height":160},
		{"id":"phase-b","type":"text","text":"**Phase B — Divergence-Sensitive\nStuttering Bisimulation**\n(Python ✅ / C++ ✅)","x":840,"y":20,"width":330,"height":90},
		{"id":"phase-b-detail","type":"text","text":"- Refuses to merge a silently-infinite loop (hallucinated `while True: pass`) with a normal wait state\n- Three equivalence tiers: **functional / trace / process**\n- Python: Groote–Vaandrager + Tarjan SCC (`stuttering_engine.py`) · C++: G–V `partition_refinement` + `spot::scc_info` τ-collapse (`lifter.cpp`)","x":840,"y":150,"width":330,"height":200},
		{"id":"phase-c","type":"text","text":"**Phase C — Behavioral Clustering**\nGroup bisimulation-reduced automata: N LLM implementations cost ~**#distinct behaviors** (`clustering.py` / C++ `cluster_implementations` via `are_isomorphic`, representative = min states then min edges)","x":1260,"y":80,"width":340,"height":240},
		{"id":"phase-d","type":"text","text":"**Phase D — Model Checking (canonical)**\nC++ ✅ `check_compliance`: SPOT parse → ¬φ Büchi → `spot::product` → `is_empty()` + `accepting_run()` counterexample.\n**Alive-extension LTLf→LTL bridge** (`spot::from_ltlf`, De Giacomo–Vardi) + mutual-exclusion edge closure for non-looping automata (PR #70); **atom-matching gate → INCONCLUSIVE** on unmatched atoms (PR #67).\nPython legacy: reachability-BFS (`model_checker.py`, `run_pipeline` — explicitly LEGACY; sole home of loop-bound checking, an open gap)","x":1680,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":280},
		{"id":"verdict","type":"text","text":"**Verdict per cluster**\nCOMPLIANT / VIOLATION + counterexample / INCONCLUSIVE\nRendered readable by `counterexample.py` (task sequence filtered to the violated property's own atoms)","x":2120,"y":90,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"service","type":"text","text":"**HTTP service (PR #74)**\nFastAPI `src/main.py` (132 LOC), Docker CMD `uvicorn src.main:app` :8000\n`POST /lift` (type-lifting + semantic matching demo) · `POST /check` (property_ingest + process_wir_batch, expects call-order WIR) · `GET /health`","x":1680,"y":460,"width":380,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"track-python","type":"text","text":"**Track 1 — Pure-Python pipeline (~1,470 LOC core)** — intact\n`module_03_equiv/src/`: `lifter.py`, `stuttering_engine.py`, `clustering.py`, `model_checker.py` (BFS product reachability — legacy Phase D)","x":420,"y":480,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"4"},
